The objective of the third homework assignment is to practice implementing asynchronous operation processing using a message queue and a function‑as‑a‑service (FaaS) platform.

Select a web application of your choice and implement—within an existing or newly created sample application—the Asynchronous Messaging design pattern. Your solution must include both implementation and a practical demonstration.

Examples of scenarios suitable for asynchronous processing include:
- Periodic extraction of source data from external systems
- Computationally expensive tasks, such as image resampling for files uploaded to Azure Blob Storage
- High‑volume operations, such as sending a newsletter to a large number of recipients
- Fast ingestion of new measurements into a queue, followed by asynchronous persistence and alert triggering

Use PaaS cloud services with minimal operational cost for deploying and running both the application and its storage layer.

Bring the sample application into a fully operational state so that it is publicly accessible on the DNS address assigned by the cloud provider.